Z||000007||Mach10||10-27-2001||05:35 AM||||I'll get working on my electronic engineering degree so that we can work out the ECM problems  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> <P>Hell, no-one's fixed the N* V-8 YET  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||1
Z||000008||lou||10-27-2001||05:52 AM||||All the electronics for the engine and transmission are self contained on top of the intake manifold.  This means a straight forward positive and negative connection and your done. The engine is smaller than a 350 chevy and 96 pounds lighter .  It will debut on the 2003 model Eldorado ev with 450 hp and will gain 150hp over the coming years. Watch for it at the SEMA show in Vegas as they are already designing after market parts for them.||||reg||1
